  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Targeted support to the Climate and Land Use Alliance 2018-22 strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Brazil and Indonesia CLUA aims to contribute to acheiving massive emission reductions from deforestation and forest degradation. CLUA also aims to contribute to maintain and increase the role of forest carbon sinks (Natural Carbon Capture) and to contribute to a shift in protein consumption in Brazil, China and Central Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
